# Every describe response (TTC message 0x10) of an sqlplus session through
# dbbat against Oracle 23ai Free: the TNS Data payload, two data-flag bytes
# first, exactly as extractTTCPayload receives it.
#
# The last one describes a deliberately wide set of column types — see
# ociDescribeQuery — and is what pins the fixed-width column record against
# real values rather than against runs of zeros.
#
# Regenerate with:
#   ORACLE_CAPTURE_OCI_FIXTURES=1 ORACLE_TEST_OCI_CLIENT=container \
#     go test -tags integration -run TestCapture_OCIFixturesThroughDBBat ./internal/proxy/oracle/



